Decorator design pattern allow add additional behaviours to existing class without changing class or inheriting it.
Decorator wrap the existing class to special wrapper classes which has behaviours.

Lets say we want to Make Coffee with below options
Simple Coffee
  --> Coffee with Suger
  --> Coffee with Suger and Milk
  --> Coffee with Suger, Milk and Chocolate etc

if we inherite class that will be bad idea

Solution Decorator start base class/behaviour and wrap extra behaviour at runtime